    description: "Found by the 2026-10-31 docstring staleness audit (dev 5f6b2af921): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_10312026/review and verify). Corpus impact not measured. The Svelte/Vue loops call _extract_symbols once per block (js_ts.py:7681, 7715), each minting make_file_id(lang, path). <script lang=ts> plus <script setup lang=ts> gives two typescript:B.vue:1-1:file:file nodes in survey output; a mixed Svelte file gives two file nodes. v03."  # 1ce7
