  nonce: 0d7e  # 0d7e
  message: "Fixed in PR #1983 (79f4e3ef61 on dev). Root cause: _extract_symbols minted a file symbol per parsed <script> block, and edges took their source id from the block language. Now every block of a Svelte/Vue file is extracted against one file symbol (typescript if any block is TS), its span covers all blocks, and imports from every block start at it. Live repro on merged dev: hypergumbo survey on B.vue (<script lang=ts> plus <script setup lang=ts>) and C.svelte (JS module block plus TS instance block): rc=0, exactly one file symbol each, typescript:B.vue:1-1:file:file and typescript:C.svelte:1-1:file:file (before: two each). Tests: test_js_ts_sfc_one_file_symbol.py (8, 7 red before). Corpus: duplicate file ids 2 to 0."  # 0d7e
